sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Browser chat UI
    participant Django as Django chatbot view
    participant Groq as Groq language model
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Recommender as Recommendation service

    User->>UI: Ask about meal history and food ideas
    UI->>Django: Authenticated POST with message and session history
    Django->>Groq: Conversation, system prompt, available tools
    Groq-->>Django: Tool call request(s)

    loop For each requested tool call
        alt Profile and allergy lookup
            Django->>DB: Read current user's profile and allergies
            DB-->>Django: Profile and allergy fields
        else Recent meal history
            Django->>DB: Read current user's recent meal logs
            DB-->>Django: Meals, portions, dates, and nutrition
        else Saved likes and dislikes
            Django->>DB: Read current user's recommendation feedback
            DB-->>Django: Liked and disliked foods
        else Current food suggestions
            Django->>Recommender: Generate suggestions for current user
            Recommender->>DB: Read eligible foods, profile, logs, and feedback
            DB-->>Recommender: User-scoped data and food candidates
            Recommender-->>Django: Ranked current recommendations
        end
        Django-->>Groq: Structured tool result
        Groq-->>Django: Next tool request or final answer
    end

    Django->>Django: Store bounded conversation history
    Django-->>UI: Final answer or friendly error
    UI->>UI: Render response and scroll to latest message
    UI-->>User: Display assistant reply
